[~] APIRegistry.sol (Discovery Layer)
- store APIs + pricing so agents can discover
REQUIREMENTS:
    - core storage
    - API struct
    - core func
        - register API
            - adds API to registry
            - Generates unique ID
            - Emits event
        - get API (used by ff:)
            - agents
            - backend
            - frontend marketplace
        - updateAPI (for provider)
            - change price
            - disable API
        - viewHelpers (totalAPI, getAPIId)
            - frontend listing
        - main entry (sample func)
            - function settle
                (
                    address payer,
                    address provider,
                    uint256 amount,
                    bytes signature,
                    bytes32 nonce,
                    uint256 deadline
                )
