[~] x402Facilitator.sol (Payment Layer)
- verifies USDC payment and unlocks API access
REQUIREMENTS:
    - verify payment signature (EIP-3009): (checks ff:)
        - signature valid
        - correct spender
        - correct amount
        - not expired
    - exe USDC transfer (flow:)
        - take signed authorization
        - call USDC transferWithAuthorization
        - move funds
    - fee split
        - provider gets 99%
        - protocol gets 1%
    - nonce protection
        - prevent replay atk
